  "title": "Almost Here",
  "durationHint": 235,
  "timed": true,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "I dreamed my mother held a secret in her hands",
      "section": "Verse 1",
      "t": 12.55
    },
    {
      "text": "Something small and shining she was scared to plan",
      "section": "Verse 1",
      "t": 18.98
    },
    {
      "text": "We talked like it was promised, like the house could grow",
      "section": "Verse 1",
      "t": 25.01
    },
    {
      "text": "I saw a future I was never meant to know",
      "section": "Verse 1",
      "t": 31.23
    },
    {
      "text": "For a minute it was easy",
      "section": "Pre-Chorus",
      "t": 37.28
    },
    {
      "text": "For a minute it was true",
      "section": "Pre-Chorus",
      "t": 40.38
    },
    {
      "text": "I had a name inside my mouth",
      "section": "Pre-Chorus",
      "t": 43.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I never got to give to you",
      "section": "Pre-Chorus",
      "t": 46.63
    },
    {
      "text": "You were almost here",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 52.45
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost breathing in the quiet",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 57.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost part of us",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 61.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the morning took the light",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 66.73
    },
    {
      "text": "I woke up empty-handed",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 71.15
    },
    {
      "text": "With a love that had no name",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 74.72
    },
    {
      "text": "You were almost here",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 77.44
    },
    {
      "text": "And it hurt me just the same",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "t": 82.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I watched her smile like hope had finally come home",
      "section": "Verse 2",
      "t": 90.59
    },
    {
      "text": "After all the years of learning how to live alone",
      "section": "Verse 2",
      "t": 96.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I reached for something living in a room that wasn’t real",
      "section": "Verse 2",
      "t": 102.97
    },
    {
      "text": "And I felt the kind of joy you’re not supposed to steal",
      "section": "Verse 2",
      "t": 109.01
